<title>USA: Racing Champions in deal with Viacom.</title>
<headline>Racing Champions in deal with Viacom.</headline>
<dateline>GLEN ELLYN, Ill. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Racing Champions Corp said Monday it will launch a line of pewter sculptures of characters from the movie Star Trek beginning in 1998 under a deal with Viacom Inc.</p>
<p>Under a three-year deal with Viacom's Consumer Products unit, Racing Champions said it would market figures including Captain James T. Kirk, Mr. Spock, Captain Picard, The U.S.S. Enterprise and most of the other characters and vehicles from all four Star Trek television series and the first eight Star Trek motion pictures.</p>
<p>-- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
